# Keep every published byte identical to the frozen package.
#
# Without this, a clone on any machine whose git has core.autocrlf=true (the
# Git-for-Windows default) rewrites text files to CRLF on checkout: SKILL.md
# then hashes to 85add11f… instead of the frozen F6E1E404…, and a
# directory-discovered copy of the skill is no longer byte-identical to the
# packaged one. Pin LF in the repository and on every checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The release archive is a frozen binary artifact; never touch its bytes.
*.zip binary
